  "title": "Global Expansion Starts with Global Consistency",
  "summary": "Building a global presence has never been easier become a strategic necessity for animal health organizations. New markets, manufacturing sites, distribution partners, and veterinary networks create opportunities to expand programs across regions. The challenge is not reaching those regions. The challenge is maintaining the same quality standards, operational controls, visibility, and compliance readiness everywhere a program operates.",
